{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.2.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "efe-msw-otel",
  "title": "EFE Meta-Swarm \u2014 OTel Pipeline",
  "description": "OpenTelemetry span exporter health \u2014 export rate, drop reasons, batch latency. Critical for trace-based debugging.",
  "tags": [
    "efe",
    "meta-swarm",
    "pr19",
    "otel",
    "tracing"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "prometheus_ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_otel_exported_spans_total, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Environment",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_otel_exported_spans_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "runbook_base",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
        "current": {
          "text": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
          "value": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "skipUrlSync": true,
        "label": "runbook base URL"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans exported (rate)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_exported_spans_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "spans/s exported",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spans dropped by reason (rate, stacked)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_dropped_spans_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\",env=~\"$env\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "export_error"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "queue_full"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "sum"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Drop ratio (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_dropped_spans_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_dropped_spans_total[5m])) + sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_exported_spans_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Collector up",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(up{job=~\".*otel-collector.*\"})",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Export duration p50 / p95 / p99",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_export_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_export_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_export_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Effective sample rate vs target",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "description": "If trace-based debugging requires N % sampling, this stat tells you if the configured sampler is being respected by the collector tail-sampler.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_otel_exported_spans_total[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_iterate_total[5m])), 0.001)",
          "legendFormat": "exported / iterate",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 4
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "OTel diagnostic references",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Drop reasons taxonomy (closed)** :\n- `queue_full` \u2014 BatchSpanProcessor backpressure (collector slow)\n- `export_error` \u2014 collector unreachable / TLS / quota\n- `timeout` \u2014 collector accepted but did not respond in time\n- `shutdown` \u2014 drop during process shutdown drain\n\n**Linked alerts** : [A6 OTelExporterFailing](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW6.md) (warn @ 10% drop) \u00b7 `MetaSwarmOtelDropRateHigh` (info @ 1% drop, PR #18)\n\n**Pivot** : [D9 Trace Explorer](/d/efe-msw-traces) when sampling is healthy.\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}